@startuml
title Figure 4.5: Activity Diagram of the Generate Unit Tests.
start
:scan_source_files(projectPath)\nsource tree (skips venv/tests/__init__/conftest);
:check_generation_env(interpreter)\nPython & Pynguin version health check;
if (UTF-8 BOM files detected?) then (yes)
  :check_python_bom(files)\nshow confirmation dialog;
  :strip_python_bom(files)\nnon-destructive BOM removal;
else (no)
endif

:Select target module(s);
:Configure advanced settings\nalgorithm (MOSA/DYNAMOSA/WSPA/RANDOM), search time,\nseed, chromosome length, population, assertion generation;
:generate_tests(...)\nper-module Pynguin subprocess;
repeat
  :Stream generation progress\n(events: generation-progress / generation-output);
repeat while (More modules?) is (yes) not (no)

if (User cancelled?) then (yes)
  :cancel_run(runId);
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Run rename_generated_tests.py\n(semantic renaming of test_case_N names);
:Scan output directory\ncount_test_cases -> test_case_count per file;
:Emit generation-finished {generatedFiles};
:Save generation history\n(save_generation_history + save_generation_file_details);
stop
@enduml
